{"title": "US Aircraft Carrier USS George Washington Arrives in Middle East", "summary": "The US aircraft carrier USS George Washington has arrived in the Middle East. It will relieve the USS Abraham Lincoln, which has been deployed in the region for an extended period. The USS Abraham Lincoln is now heading home. The deployment is part of a routine rotation of naval assets in the region.", "summary_points": ["USS George Washington arrived in the Middle East.", "It replaces the USS Abraham Lincoln.", "The USS Abraham Lincoln was deployed for a long duration.", "The USS Abraham Lincoln is returning home."], "title_hi": "अमेरिकी विमानवाहक पोत यूएसएस जॉर्ज वाशिंगटन मध्य पूर्व पहुंचा", "summary_hi": "अमेरिकी विमानवाहक पोत यूएसएस जॉर्ज वाशिंगटन मध्य पूर्व में पहुंच गया है। यह यूएसएस अब्राहम लिंकन की जगह लेगा, जो लंबे समय से क्षेत्र में तैनात था। यूएसएस अब्राहम लिंकन अब घर लौट रहा है। यह तैनाती क्षेत्र में नौसैनिक संपत्तियों के नियमित रोटेशन का हिस्सा है।", "summary_points_hi": ["यूएसएस जॉर्ज वाशिंगटन मध्य पूर्व में पहुंचा।", "यह यूएसएस अब्राहम लिंकन की जगह लेगा।", "यूएसएस अब्राहम लिंकन लंबे समय से तैनात था।", "यूएसएस अब्राहम लिंकन घर लौट रहा है।"], "framing": {}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "International", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "Le Monde", "owner": "Le Monde", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "New US aircraft carrier arrives in Middle East to relieve long-deployed ship"}, {"source": "Gulf News", "owner": "Gulf News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "USS George Washington arrives in Middle East as long-deployed USS Abraham Lincoln heads home"}, {"source": "NBC News", "owner": "NBC News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNcFNlUERvdGhRUlAzTHgyZjhwQUZ1YlFBUHBCeE05NUY2ZW5ZNmZMRWdsLWtRSTA2U0FhdkUtOVU2bDJ6NjAtOWMtWVlqMEFuMGZyRXhVQjdKRFdweGhIZHEzdjdYelVUWkZw